Package: lemuri
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: openssh-client
Description: SSH console for your servers
 Lemuri is a free, open-source, lightweight desktop SSH client for managing
 servers and VPS: hosts in folders, shells in tabs and split panes, SFTP
 transfers from the terminal, live metrics, pending updates and an SSH
 security check for each server, an encrypted password vault, encrypted
 backups and hosts shared with a team.
 .
 It is a native Qt 6 application written in C++.
